{"id":"n57278-2-9","stage":1,"title":"깎다 · 剪","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57278-2-9-1","ko":"머리를 왜 그렇게 짧게 깎았어?","zh":"为什么把头发剪得这么短啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리를","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리를","audio":"/audio/7100300a7b419bcb6fd3.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"짧게","meaning":"剪短","explanation":"짧다：长度短；-게 表示使头发达到短的状态，不是指时间短。","readings":[{"term":"짧다","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71363","senseId":"1","lemma":"짧다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짧게","audio":"/audio/d68f30912311d995dabc.mp3"}},{"text":"깎았어?","meaning":"剪","explanation":"깎다：剪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"2","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깎았어","audio":"/audio/32352f580c122d26a144.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6dab7d40289b180d","term":"짧다","zh":"短","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3","entryId":"71363","definition":"空间长度短；本句指头发的长度。","pronunciation":["짤따"]},{"id":"18d3575b885757d9","term":"깎다","zh":"剪","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3","entryId":"57278","definition":"把草或毛等切短。","pronunciation":["깍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5e5f29fe4af35d98c3e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57278-2-9-2","ko":"다음 주에 군대에 가거든.","zh":"因为下周我就要去当兵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"下（周）","explanation":"다음：下一次；与 주 连用，表示“下周”。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에","audio":"/audio/28e7aef02277c8ef3bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"군대에","meaning":"部队，军队","explanation":"군대：部队，军队；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"군대","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60101","senseId":"1","lemma":"군대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"군대에","audio":"/audio/3c5d6ec0fda95e5323a2.mp3"}},{"text":"가거든.","meaning":"要去当兵","explanation":"가다：去；-거든 用来补充说明理由；“군대에 가다”在这里指入伍。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가거든","audio":"/audio/c004ed2e4cf25b32b6e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下一、下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"在当前时间或顺序之后的；“다음 주”表示下周。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"05ea65477ab09b87","term":"군대","zh":"部队，军队","audio":"/audio/05ea65477ab09b876055.mp3","entryId":"60101","definition":"具有一定的规律和秩序的军人的集体。","pronunciation":["군대"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54d572b7824c12b2d55d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57278","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为下周我就要去当兵了。","照片都好模糊啊。","为什么把头发剪得这么短啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为下周我就要去当兵了。","为什么把头发剪得这么短啊？","照片都好模糊啊。"],"answer":0}]}
